	- appears as if structures are used for "mailbox" commands,
	  and whatnot

In any case, the driver would basically need a complete re-write anyhow, 
for at least 3 reasons:

	- NetBSD's autoconfiguration structure

	- NetBSD's machine-independent SCSI subsystem

	- <machine/bus.h>

